    "title": "Rob Reiner's sister Annie reportedly supports \"rapidly deteriorating\" Nick Reiner amid murder case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Enoba Onuh ,\n29 minutes ago\nNick Reiner’s health is reportedly deteriorating in prison — source Getty Images © Getty Images Nick Reiner’s health is reportedly deteriorating in prison — source Getty Images\nNick Reiner still has his aunt's support, per Page Six. The 32-year-old, who is on trial for the murder of his parents, has enjoyed the support of his aunt Annie Reiner since he was charged, a source told the news outlet.\nAnnie, sister to the deceased director Rob Reiner, and sister-in-law to Michele Singer Reiner, has “remained in his (Nick’s) corner and her presence has meant a great deal to him.”\nNick, who is battling his siblings in private court for access to his $1.5 million trust fund, is said to be “rapidly deteriorating” and almost unrecognizable due to the intense medication he’s on.\n“He is rapidly deteriorating. No one would recognize him,” a source told The Daily Mail. “He is almost bald because they have to keep his hair super short to keep the bugs out, and he is super skinny because of the intense medication he is on. His eyes are very sunken in,” the insider said.",
